# Git commits — no Cursor co-author

When creating git commits:

- Never add `Co-authored-by: Cursor` or any similar Cursor/agent co-author trailer
- Commit messages must attribute only the human author from git config
- Do not append co-author footers unless the user explicitly asks for a specific human co-author
